{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcrossui\/gtk3backend"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/DefaultBackend","doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/AppKitBackend","doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/UIKitBackend","doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/WinUIBackend","doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/GtkBackend"],"generated":true}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/Gtk3Backend","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"Gtk3Backend","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiftCrossUI"}],"role":"article"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI","doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/Built-in-backends"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This backend supports Linux, macOS and Windows (maybe?), but its support for non-Linux platforms is significantly worse than "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/GtkBackend"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s (due to underlying Gtk 3 issues). Even on Linux, it’s recommended to use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/GtkBackend"},{"type":"text","text":" over Gtk3Backend where possible."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Non-Linux Gtk3Backend support is not a priority of this backend, and should only be used during development (e.g. to test your Linux UI natively on a Mac). There are multiple better choices of backend available on each non-Linux platform.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"warning","type":"aside","name":"Warning"},{"anchor":"System-dependencies","type":"heading","text":"System dependencies","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before you can use Gtk3Backend you must install the required system dependencies for your platform.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Linux","type":"heading","text":"Linux","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","code":["sudo apt install libgtk-3-dev"],"syntax":"sh"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Figure 1: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"installing Gtk 3 dev on an apt-based Linux distro"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you are on a non-apt distro and the Gtk3Backend requirements end up differing significantly from the requirements stated above, please open a GitHub issue or PR so that we can improve the documentation."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"macOS","type":"heading","text":"macOS","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","code":["brew install pkg-config gtk+3"],"syntax":"sh"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Figure 2: "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"installing Gtk 3 using Homebrew","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you don’t have Homebrew, installation instructions can be found at "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/brew.sh","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It should also be possible to use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gtk3"},{"type":"text","text":" installed via MacPorts, but I have not tested that."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Windows","type":"heading","text":"Windows","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"gtk3","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" installation has not been tested on Windows, and neither has Gtk3Backend, although there shouldn’t be anything to stop it from working (🤞). Follow the "},{"code":"gtk4","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" installation instructions from "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/GtkBackend","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and replace "},{"code":"gtk","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"gtk3","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in any vcpkg commands or "},{"code":"vcpkg.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" manifest files."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you try this on Windows open a GitHub issue (even if it works without changes) so that we can fix any issues you faced and update this documentation."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Usage","type":"heading","text":"Usage","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","code":["...","","let package = Package(","  ...","  targets: [","    ...","    .executableTarget(","      name: \"YourApp\",","      dependencies: [","        .product(name: \"SwiftCrossUI\", package: \"swift-cross-ui\"),","        .product(name: \"GtkBackend\", package: \"swift-cross-ui\"),","      ]","    )","    ...","  ]","  ...",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Figure 3: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"adding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gtk3Backend"},{"type":"text","text":" to an executable target"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftCrossUI","import Gtk3Backend","","@main","struct YourApp: App {","  \/\/ You can explicitly initialize your app's chosen backend if you desire.","  \/\/ This happens automatically when you import any of the built-in backends.","  \/\/","  \/\/ var backend = Gtk3Backend()","  \/\/","  \/\/ If you aren't using Swift Bundler, you may have to explicitly provide","  \/\/ your app's identifier for some Gtk3Backend features to work correctly","  \/\/ (such as handling custom URL schemes).","  \/\/","  \/\/ var backend = Gtk3Backend(appIdentifier: \"com.example.YourApp\")","","  var body: some Scene {","    WindowGroup {","      Text(\"Hello, World!\")","        .padding()","    }","  }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Figure 4: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gtk3Backend"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A secondary Linux backend built on top of Gtk 3 (for older distros without Gtk 4)."}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://SwiftCrossUI/documentation/SwiftCrossUI/Built-in-backends":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcrossui\/built-in-backends","kind":"article","title":"Built-in backends","type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/Built-in-backends"},"doc://SwiftCrossUI/documentation/SwiftCrossUI/WinUIBackend":{"type":"topic","title":"WinUIBackend","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/WinUIBackend","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcrossui\/winuibackend","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftCrossUI’s native Windows backend built on top of WinUI 3."}]},"doc://SwiftCrossUI/documentation/SwiftCrossUI/AppKitBackend":{"type":"topic","title":"AppKitBackend","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/AppKitBackend","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcrossui\/appkitbackend","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftCrossUI’s native macOS backend built on top of AppKit."}],"kind":"article"},"doc://SwiftCrossUI/documentation/SwiftCrossUI/UIKitBackend":{"abstract":[{"text":"SwiftCrossUI’s native iOS and tvOS backend built on top of UIKit.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcrossui\/uikitbackend","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic","title":"UIKitBackend","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCrossUI\/documentation\/SwiftCrossUI\/UIKitBackend"},"doc://SwiftCrossUI/documentation/SwiftCrossUI":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Create cross-platform desktop apps for macOS, Linux, Windows, iOS and tvOS."}],"ide